# Funk-pop (urban / neo-funk): 8 verses, 6 pre-choruses, 7 choruses and 4 bridges.
# Tight 16th-note bursts with rests, dominant-7th and minor-7th vamps (C7-F7, Am7-D7, Dm7-G7), blue thirds and
# sevenths, swagger and call and response at 95-118 bpm.

